                    "underline": false
                },
                {
                    "bold": false,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": " Friday the fifth to Sunday the seventh.",
                    "underline": false
                },
                {
                    "bold": false,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": "\n",
                    "underline": false
                },
                {
                    "bold": true,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": "A:",
                    "underline": false
                },
                {
                    "bold": false,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": " Let me check availability for those dates. Thank you for waiting. Yes, we have a Deluxe Room available at 80 dollars per night. Would you like me to book it for you?",
                    "underline": false
                },
                {
                    "bold": false,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": "\n",
                    "underline": false
                },
                {
                    "bold": true,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": "C:",
                    "underline": false
                },
                {
                    "bold": false,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": " Yes, please.",
                    "underline": false
                },
                {
                    "bold": false,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": "\n",
                    "underline": false
                },
                {
                    "bold": true,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": "A:",
                    "underline": false
                },
                {
                    "bold": false,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": " Lovely. Could I take your name and a contact number?",
                    "underline": false
                },
                {
                    "bold": false,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": "\n",
                    "underline": false
                },
                {
                    "bold": true,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": "C:",
                    "underline": false
                },
                {
                    "bold": false,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": " David Chen, and my number is 0812 3456 7890.",
                    "underline": false
                },
                {
                    "bold": false,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": "\n",
                    "underline": false
                },
                {
                    "bold": true,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": "A:",
                    "underline": false
                },
                {
                    "bold": false,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": " Thank you. Let me read that back to be sure. David Chen, a Deluxe Room, two nights, arriving Friday the fifth. Is that correct?",
                    "underline": false
                },
                {
                    "bold": false,
                    "italic": false,
